    "title": "Call Details of Any\u00a0Number",
    "description": "Call history keeps your call history forever and lists them category-wise.\r\n\r\nCall History of Any Number Call Details allows you to export calls to an excel file. This app can back up your logs and restore them on the same phone or other, Quick and advanced search options helps you to easily access the data you are looking for.\r\n\r\nGet 100% Real call history of any number any person from all around the world. it helps you to find any person's call history details data and make your work easy.\r\n\r\nCall History Manager Keep up to the past 1000 days' call logs and list them category-wise for ease of access. Quick and advanced search options help you to easily access the data you are looking for. There are many other features included to manage your call logs easily and efficiently.\r\n\r\nHow to get the call history of any number application helps Indian prepaid telecom users to find the numbers for specific operations like Recharge, Main, Message, Net Balance inquiry, Finding their own number, and customer care number.\r\n\r\nPlease note that this app cannot recover the call history that got deleted from the phone before installing this app. Once installed, this app will keep logs even if it gets deleted from the phone.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:-\r\nThis App does not present itself as a spying or secret surveillance and does not contains Viruses, Trojan horses, malware, spyware or any other malicious software also is not have any related functionality or plugins. This app does not show call history.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Call history keeps your call history forever and lists them category-wise.<br><br>Call History of Any Number Call Details allows you to export calls to an excel file. This app can back up your logs and restore them on the same phone or other, Quick and advanced search options helps you to easily access the data you are looking for.<br><br>Get 100% Real call history of any number any person from all around the world. it helps you to find any person&#39;s call history details data and make your work easy.<br><br>Call History Manager Keep up to the past 1000 days&#39; call logs and list them category-wise for ease of access. Quick and advanced search options help you to easily access the data you are looking for. There are many other features included to manage your call logs easily and efficiently.<br><br>How to get the call history of any number application helps Indian prepaid telecom users to find the numbers for specific operations like Recharge, Main, Message, Net Balance inquiry, Finding their own number, and customer care number.<br><br>Please note that this app cannot recover the call history that got deleted from the phone before installing this app. Once installed, this app will keep logs even if it gets deleted from the phone.<br><br>Disclaimer:-<br>This App does not present itself as a spying or secret surveillance and does not contains Viruses, Trojan horses, malware, spyware or any other malicious software also is not have any related functionality or plugins. This app does not show call history.",
